{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大块保留了完整的缘由、转折和体验，单看大字更容易理解每屏在讲什么；X的强调短语在个别屏幕上会漏掉关键对象。small：Y把观众感受和音乐旁注分开，补充内容与出现的音乐段落衔接较清楚。core：两版都完整呈现了维护尊严与怀念旧日归属之间的反复拉扯，结尾也都落在不为留住陪伴而再次忍受委屈，判平。concise：X的小字较少反复解释大字已经表达的心理，Y在S10、S11、S13有几处对疲惫、前进和安定的重复补述。human：X更符合日常说话习惯；Y的“想起从前暖了一会儿”“舍不得被人当自己人”“想得很累也没答案”等搭配或省略略显生硬。fine：X的“我到底在气谁又在想谁”“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”等表达更有辨识度，呈现了具体的内心体验。load：X每屏只需扫过较短的强调短语，Y则有多条较长的大块，尤其S06、S07、S13，累积阅读负担更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "73cc0ff4-8a06-429a-b7dd-915076882565", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T222416141235Z", "elapsed_seconds": 198.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:27:34.777279+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37b727db577bf3a36f0c3fb232522e9136c004df688b40210b83c7a0b952906b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de